  "totalBlocks": 72,
  "translatedBlocks": 72,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "98229320ad9a45ad",
      "translationZh": "ggml 是一个用 C 和 C++ 编写的机器学习（ML）库，专注于 Transformer 推理。该项目是开源的，由一个不断壮大的社区积极开发。ggml 与 PyTorch 和 TensorFlow 等机器学习库类似，不过它仍处于开发早期阶段，一些基础设计仍在快速变化。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9da35044a83c621e",
      "translationZh": "随着时间的推移，ggml 与 llama.cpp 和 whisper.cpp 等其他项目一同日益流行。许多其他项目也在底层使用 ggml 来实现设备端 LLM，包括 ollama、jan、LM Studio、GPT4All。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8a2353a4e8328cfa",
      "translationZh": "人们选择使用 ggml 而非其他库的主要原因如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "2c74bd47ca0814ff",
      "translationZh": "极简：核心库自成一体，文件数量少于 5 个。虽然你可能希望引入额外的文件以支持 GPU，但这并非必需。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "42162bf82029f8b3",
      "translationZh": "编译简单：你不需要复杂的构建工具。如果不需要 GPU 支持，你只需要 GCC 或 Clang！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "52a140b0f78a8efe",
      "translationZh": "轻量：编译后的二进制文件大小小于 1MB，与 PyTorch（通常占用数百 MB）相比非常小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bf6d252e0a5304b5",
      "translationZh": "兼容性好：它支持多种类型的硬件，包括 x86_64、ARM、Apple Silicon、CUDA 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cc87999cca138175",
      "translationZh": "支持量化张量：可以对张量进行量化以节省内存（类似于 JPEG 压缩），并且在某些情况下还能提升性能。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0ddbdf29fe92864b",
      "translationZh": "内存效率极高：存储张量和执行计算所需的额外开销极小。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bf9dfc297cf7fc23",
      "translationZh": "不过，ggml 也有一些缺点，使用时需要注意（此列表可能会随 ggml 的未来版本而变化）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "8666c3d3dd53c93a",
      "translationZh": "并非所有后端都支持全部张量操作。例如，某些操作可能可以在 CPU 上运行，却无法在 CUDA 上运行。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ec31fce8cd195274",
      "translationZh": "使用 ggml 进行开发可能并不简单，而且可能需要深入掌握底层编程知识。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9800f337b2661324",
      "translationZh": "该项目正在积极开发中，因此预计会出现破坏性变更。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9896bbe1904f09bd",
      "translationZh": "本文将重点介绍 ggml 的基础知识，面向希望开始使用该库的开发者。我们不会涉及更高层的任务，例如使用基于 ggml 构建的 llama.cpp 进行 LLM 推理。相反，我们将探索 ggml 的核心概念和基本用法，为进一步学习和开发打下坚实基础。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "831d0f72d242b7d1",
      "translationZh": "入门",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "686bacbd138e3c52",
      "translationZh": "很好，那么该如何开始呢？",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ef64f334bf7cf97b",
      "translationZh": "为简单起见，本指南将向你展示如何在 Ubuntu 上编译 ggml。实际上，你几乎可以在任何平台上编译 ggml（包括 Windows、macOS 和 BSD）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07d10aafc2447062",
      "translationZh": "预期输出：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7165b7aeb3402744",
      "translationZh": "如果你看到了预期结果，就说明一切就绪，可以继续了！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "fc773e096fdc0642",
      "translationZh": "术语与概念",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "07dfdfe8c37af4bb",
      "translationZh": "在深入了解 ggml 之前，我们应该先理解一些关键概念。如果你之前使用的是 PyTorch 或 TensorFlow 这样的高级库，这些概念可能会显得难以理解。不过，请记住，ggml 是一个底层库。理解这些术语可以让你对性能有更大的掌控力：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6e31d37303e37c9f",
      "translationZh": "ggml_context：一个“容器”，用于存放张量、图等对象，也可选择存放数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "9115b88d384924be",
      "translationZh": "ggml_cgraph：表示一个计算图。可以将其理解为将被传递给后端的“计算顺序”。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ba9dbe97a040f8b6",
      "translationZh": "ggml_backend：表示用于执行计算图的接口。后端有多种类型：CPU（默认）、CUDA、Metal（Apple Silicon）、Vulkan、RPC 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b1136b14d9a08cb7",
      "translationZh": "ggml_backend_buffer_type：表示一种缓冲区类型。可以将其理解为与每个 ggml_backend 相连的“内存分配器”。例如，如果要在 GPU 上执行计算，就需要通过 buffer_type（通常缩写为 buft）在 GPU 上分配内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "6d50ca45afbb808e",
      "translationZh": "ggml_backend_buffer：表示由 buffer_type 分配的缓冲区。请记住：一个缓冲区可以存放多个张量的数据。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0feecc95077f9349",
      "translationZh": "ggml_gallocr：表示图内存分配器，用于高效地为计算图中使用的张量分配内存。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "844de8e540a39312",
      "translationZh": "ggml_backend_sched：一种支持并发使用多个后端的调度器。在处理大型模型或使用多个 GPU 时，它可以将计算分配到不同的硬件（例如 GPU 和 CPU）上。调度器还可以自动将 GPU 不支持的操作分配给 CPU，确保最佳的资源利用率和兼容性。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "01a354caf4331ec8",
      "translationZh": "简单示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0193e80afee5607b",
      "translationZh": "在这个示例中，我们将逐步复现“入门”部分中运行的代码。我们需要创建 2 个矩阵，将它们相乘并获取结果。使用 PyTorch 时，代码如下：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a0b9ec61f8194017",
      "translationZh": "使用 ggml 时，必须完成以下步骤才能得到相同的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "90db09b44143fceb",
      "translationZh": "分配 ggml_context 以存储张量数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "cfeca74991dd57fc",
      "translationZh": "创建张量并设置数据",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4484b1f07700879",
      "translationZh": "为 mul_mat 运算创建一个 ggml_cgraph",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e28b85f0c674885",
      "translationZh": "执行计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "990c03d2b48aa707",
      "translationZh": "获取结果（输出张量）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f8f5f13d2991b70",
      "translationZh": "释放内存并退出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6afd3e483a2b71ec",
      "translationZh": "注意：在本示例中，为了简单起见，我们将在 ggml_context 内部分配张量数据。实际使用时，应以设备缓冲区的形式分配内存，我们将在下一节中介绍这一点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a39f46b703a34ea",
      "translationZh": "首先，让我们创建一个新目录 examples/demo",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf782e61999c63d6",
      "translationZh": "本示例的代码基于 simple-ctx.cpp",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3c931c2f83d1105a",
      "translationZh": "用以下内容编辑 examples/demo/demo.c：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "dbb60cf36d8b4202",
      "translationZh": "将以下几行写入你创建的 examples/demo/CMakeLists.txt 文件：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "752e36273b364fca",
      "translationZh": "编辑 examples/CMakeLists.txt，在末尾添加这一行：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f9dee9546e7f9e4",
      "translationZh": "编译并运行它：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0045",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "661adb16f3f16dd1",
      "translationZh": "预期结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0046",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d32f21e522288bc0",
      "translationZh": "使用后端的示例",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0047",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6fc85b7e46e61ac5",
      "translationZh": "在 ggml 中，“后端”是指能够处理张量运算的接口。后端可以是 CPU、CUDA、Vulkan 等。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0048",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50415aefc0e80380",
      "translationZh": "后端对计算图的执行进行了抽象。图一旦定义好，就可以使用相应的后端实现，在可用硬件上执行计算。请注意，ggml 会自动为计算所需的所有中间张量预留内存，并根据这些中间结果的生命周期优化内存使用。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0049",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "fe24c1e78444c0af",
      "translationZh": "使用后端进行计算或推理时，通常需要执行以下步骤：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0050",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "bbadfac1c58ff024",
      "translationZh": "初始化 ggml_backend",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0051",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "4738140d3c9f715b",
      "translationZh": "分配 ggml_context，用于存储张量元数据（无需立即为张量数据分配内存）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0052",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "fae1a30215fb50e2",
      "translationZh": "创建张量元数据（仅包括其形状和数据类型）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0053",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "d8fee720e077557d",
      "translationZh": "分配一个 ggml_backend_buffer，用于存储所有张量",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0054",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "ad75edfc6a2e8e23",
      "translationZh": "将张量数据从主内存（RAM）复制到后端缓冲区",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0055",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "b4484b1f07700879",
      "translationZh": "为 mul_mat 运算创建一个 ggml_cgraph",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0056",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "37a086c90d0b548a",
      "translationZh": "创建一个 ggml_gallocr，用于为 cgraph 分配内存",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0057",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "15abe8026ccea421",
      "translationZh": "可选：使用 ggml_backend_sched 调度 cgraph",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0058",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "0e28b85f0c674885",
      "translationZh": "执行计算",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0059",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "990c03d2b48aa707",
      "translationZh": "获取结果（输出张量）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0060",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "5f8f5f13d2991b70",
      "translationZh": "释放内存并退出",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0061",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d242a30d506b997",
      "translationZh": "本示例的代码基于 simple-backend.cpp",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0062",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "57f0b36d3c5d5baa",
      "translationZh": "编译并运行它，你应该会得到与上一个示例相同的结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0063",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "661adb16f3f16dd1",
      "translationZh": "预期结果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0064",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "56d13755cae26290",
      "translationZh": "打印计算图",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0065",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "905e793b364828fd",
      "translationZh": "ggml_cgraph 表示计算图，它定义了后端将执行的操作顺序。打印计算图是一种很有帮助的调试手段，尤其是在处理更复杂的模型和计算时。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0066",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "094beb73bbf70bdb",
      "translationZh": "你可以添加 ggml_graph_print 来打印 cgraph：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0067",
